:: Widgets Whitney [widget]
<<widget "whitneyoptions">>
	/*add to added links, so cigarettes are removed from the scene after the player smokes with Whitney*/

	<<if $location is "park" and Time.dayState isnot "day">>
		<br><br>
		<<if C.npc.Whitney.love gte 15>>
			"I'm leaving," <<he>> says suddenly. "Don't stay out in this weather." <<He>> leaves the park without another word.
		<<else>>
			<<He>> walks away, leaving the park without a word.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<whitneyexit>>
	<<elseif $location is "flats" and Time.dayState is "dusk">>
		You hear a knock at the door. "Fun's over," Whitney says. "I've places to be. You go careful though."
		<br><br>

		<<exposure>>
		<<if $exposed gte 2 and hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 5)>>
			<<link [[Leave the flat (0:02)|Whitney Home Dusk Leave Naked]]>><<pass 2>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<npcincr Whitney lust 3>><<npcincr Whitney dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>><<glove>><<gglust>><<exhibitionist5>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $exposed is 1 and hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)>>
			<<link [[Leave the flat (0:02)|Whitney Home Dusk Leave Undies]]>><<pass 2>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<npcincr Whitney lust 3>><</link>><<glove>><<glust>><<exhibitionist3>>
			<br>
		<</if>>

		<<if $exposed gte 1>>
			<<link [[Ask for something to wear (0:02)|Whitney Home Dusk Exposed]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Leave the flat (0:02)|Whitney Home Dusk Leave]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $location is "flats" and [8,9].includes(Time.hour) and Time.schoolDay>>
		Whitney glances out the window. "Fucking school," <<he>> says. "You coming?"
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Walk to school with Whitney (0:16)|Whitney Home School Walk]]>><<pass 16>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Say you have to pick something up first (0:02)|Whitney Home School Walk Pick]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if !wearingSchoolOutfit()>>
			<<link [[Say you need to get your uniform first (0:02)|Whitney Home School Walk Uniform]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $location is "flats" and Time.hour gte 9 and Weather.precipitation isnot "none">>
		Whitney looks at the inclement weather. "That means <<loadNPC 1 "whitney_parent_flat">><<person2>><<mum>><<endevent>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>> will be here soon," <<he>> says. "I can't be fucked to deal with that. Let's go to the park."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Go to the park with Whitney (0:15)|Whitney Home Park Journey]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Just leave (0:02)|Whitney Home Park Leave]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $location is "flats" and Time.hour gte 9 and [3,6,7].includes(Time.weekDay)>>
		Whitney glances out the window, and waves at someone. "We got company," <<he>> says.
		<br><br>

		<<exposure>>
		<<if $exposed gte 2 and hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 5)>>
			<<link [[Wait for Whitney's friends to arrive (0:10)|Whitney Home Gang Arrive Naked]]>><<pass 10>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<npcincr Whitney lust 3>><<npcincr Whitney dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>><<glove>><<gglust>><<exhibitionist5>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $exposed is 1 and hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)>>
			<<link [[Wait for Whitney's friends to arrive (0:10)|Whitney Home Gang Arrive Undies]]>><<pass 10>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<npcincr Whitney lust 3>><</link>><<glove>><<glust>><<exhibitionist3>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $exposed gte 1>>
			<<link [[Ask for something to wear (0:10)|Whitney Home Gang Arrive Exposed]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Leave Whitney's room (0:10)|Whitney Home Gang Arrive]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $location is "flats" and [7,8].includes(Time.hour) and !$daily.whitney.breakfast_done>>
		"I'm famished," Whitney says. "Let's get breakfast."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Breakfast with Whitney (0:20)|Whitney Home Dawn Breakfast Start]]>><<endevent>><<set $daily.whitney.breakfast_done to true>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Leave (0:02)|Whitney Home Dawn Leave]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $location is "flats" and Time.hour is 6 and !$daily.whitney.shower_done>>
		Whitney looks at the clock on the wall. "I need a shower," <<he>> says. "Come on. You can wash me."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Shower with Whitney (0:20)|Whitney Home Dawn Shower]]>><<set $daily.whitney.shower_done to true>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Leave (0:02)|Whitney Home Dawn Leave]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $location is "flats" and Time.dayState is "dusk">>
		<br><br>
		<<if [6,7].includes(Time.weekDay)>>
			Whitney looks at a clock on the wall, which draws everyone's attention. "Time to head out," <<he>> says. <<His>> friends rise to their feet as Whitney turns to you. "That includes you, slut."
			<br><br>
			You leave the flat with Whitney and <<his>> friends, and walk down the stairs to the entrance. <<He>> pauses. "Want me to escort you to the orphanage?"
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Yes (0:05)|Whitney Home Escort Friends]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[No|Whitney Home Escort No Friends]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			Whitney looks at a clock on the wall. "My friends will be waiting for me," <<he>> says. "Thanks for the company."
			<br><br>
			You leave the flat with Whitney, and walk down the stairs to the entrance. <<He>> pauses. "Want me to escort you to the orphanage?"
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Yes (0:05)|Whitney Home Escort]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[No|Whitney Home Escort No]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $daily.whitney.parkWhore is "run" and $location is "park">>
			<<set $daily.whitney.parkWhore to true>><<run delete $daily.whitney.textTrigger>>
			"Nice getaway earlier," <<he>> suddenly says. "What, you thought I'd be mad?
			<<if $whitneyromance is 1>><<set _noOptions to true>>
				My <<girl>> knows who <<pshe>> wants."
				<br><br>

				<<He>> leans in, trapping you between <<himself>> and the tree. <<His>> lips brush your neck.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Let it happen|Whitney Park Whore Romance]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<sub 1>><<arousal 600>><<npcincr Whitney lust 5>><</link>><<garousal>><<glust>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Shove|Whitney Park Whore Romance]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<def 1>><<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				I got paid. Who cares if they didn't get what they wanted?"
			<</if>>
		<<elseif $daily.whitney.parkWhore is "paid" and C.npc.Whitney.love gte 10 and $location is "park">>
			<<set $daily.whitney.parkWhore to true>><<set _noOptions to true>><<run delete $daily.whitney.textTrigger>>
			<<He>> rummages through <<his>> <<npcClothesText $NPCList[0] "upper">> for a handful of banknotes. <<He>> shoves them in your face without looking.
			<br><br>

			"Your cut," <<he>> says. "Don't thank me."
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Get angry|Whitney Park Whore Share]]>><<printmoney 5000>><<money 5000 "prostitution">><<set $phase to 1>><<def 1>><<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Stay silent|Whitney Park Whore Share]]>><<printmoney 5000>><<money 5000 "prostitution">><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $daily.whitney.parkWhore is "runFail" and C.npc.Whitney.love gte 10 and $location is "park">>
			<<set $daily.whitney.parkWhore to true>><<set _noOptions to true>><<run delete $daily.whitney.textTrigger>>
			"Dumbass," <<he>> mutters. "You call that a getaway? Try running next time."
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Apologise|Whitney Park Run Advice]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<sub 1>><<npcincr Whitney dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Get angry|Whitney Park Run Advice]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<def 1>><<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Stay silent|Whitney Park Run Advice]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $daily.whitney.textTrigger is true>>
			<<run delete $daily.whitney.textTrigger>>
			<<if $daily.whitney.text is 1>>
				"Again? Piss off already, would you?" <<He>> looks away.
			<<elseif $daily.whitney.text is 2>>
				"You're getting on my nerves, <<bitch>>." <<He>> looks away.
			<<else>>
				<<if $whitneyromance is 1 or C.npc.Whitney.dom gte 10>>
					"What's my favourite slut doing here?"
					<<print playerBellyVisible() ?
						"<<He>> glances at your baby bump. Without you asking, <<he>> puts out the cigarette, popping a stick of gum in <<his>> mouth instead." :
						"<<He>> offers up a smile."
					>>
				<<elseif $whitneyrescued>>
					<<print playerBellyVisible() ?
						"<<He>> looks at you just long enough to take in your baby bump, then quickly looks away. <<He>> drops <<his>> cigarette and pops a stick of gum in <<his>> mouth instead." :
						"<<He>> looks at you, but quickly looks away."
					>>
				<<else>>
					<<print playerBellyVisible() ?
						"<<He>> looks annoyed, but <<he>> still puts out <<his>> cigarette when <<he>> catches sight of your baby bump. <<He>> wordlessly pops a stick of gum in <<his>> mouth instead." :
						"<<He>> looks annoyed."
					>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif C.npc.Whitney.love gte 18 and $whitney_home_timer gte 21 and !$whitney_home_stage and $whitneyromance gte 1>>
			<<set $whitney_home_timer to 0>>
			<<set _noOptions to true>>
			Whitney stares at you, a strange look in <<his>> eyes. Then <<he>> flicks <<his>> cigarette into the fountain, and grasps your arm.
			<br><br>
			"I've something to show you," <<he>> says. "It's only fifteen minutes away."
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Go with Whitney (0:30)|Whitney Home Intro 1]]>><<pass 5>><<set $whitney_home_stage to 1>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Refuse|Whitney Home Intro Refuse]]>><<npcincr Whitney love -1>><</link>><<llove>>
			<br>
		<<elseif C.npc.Whitney.love gte 18 and $whitney_home_timer gte 21 and $whitney_home_stage is 1>>
			<<set $whitney_home_timer to 0>>
			<<set _noOptions to true>>
			Whitney flicks the cigarette in the fountain as soon as <<he>> looks at you, and marches closer, looking determined. "You're coming with me, slut," <<he>> says. "I left something at home, and I'm not leaving you here where any creep can grab you."
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Go with Whitney (0:35)|Whitney Home Intro 2]]>><<pass 15>><<set $whitney_home_stage to 2>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Refuse|Whitney Home Intro Refuse]]>><<npcincr Whitney love -1>><</link>><<llove>>
			<br>
		<<elseif C.npc.Whitney.love gte 18 and $whitney_home_timer gte 21 and $whitney_home_stage is 2>>
			<<set $whitney_home_timer to 0>>
			<<set _noOptions to true>>
			Whitney notices you approach, and stares at you. Then <<he>> draws <<himself>> up, puts out the cigarette on the back of <<his>> own hand, and steps closer.
			<br><br>
			"You're just in time," <<he>> says. "I wanna show you my flat." <<He>> grabs your arm.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Go with Whitney (0:35)|Whitney Home Intro 3]]>><<pass 15>><<set $whitney_home_stage to 3>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Refuse|Whitney Home Intro Refuse]]>><<npcincr Whitney love -1>><</link>><<llove>>
			<br>
		<<elseif !$worn.handheld.type.includes("prop") and $location is "park">>
			<<if _whitney_attention is 1>>
				<<if C.npc.Whitney.lust gte 50>>
					<span class="green">Whatever was on <<his>> mind is long gone. <<His>> eyes are glued to you.</span>
				<<elseif C.npc.Whitney.lust gte 20>>
					<span class="blue">You seem to have <<his>> attention, but not all of it.</span>
				<<else>>
					<span class="pink">Whitney tries to ignore you.</span>
				<</if>>
			<<elseif $location is "park" and $rng gte 51>>
				<<He>> stares at the fountain.
			<<else>>
				<<He>> <<print playerBellyVisible() ? "blows a bubble. It pops with a snap" : "takes a drag of <<his>> cigarette">>.
			<</if>>

		<<elseif $location is "flats">>
			<<rng 3>>
			<<if _whitney_attention is 1>>
				<<if C.npc.Whitney.lust gte 50>>
					<span class="green">Whatever was on <<his>> mind is long gone. <<His>> eyes are glued to you.</span>
				<<elseif C.npc.Whitney.lust gte 20>>
					<span class="blue">You seem to have <<his>> attention, but not all of it.</span>
				<<else>>
					<span class="pink">Whitney tries to ignore you.</span>
				<</if>>
			<<elseif $rng is 3>>
				Whitney sits on the floor of <<his>> room, back against <<his>> bed, bouncing a ball off the wall.
			<<elseif $rng is 2>>
				Whitney sits on <<his>> bed, watching <<his>> arms dangle between <<his>> legs.
			<<else>>
				Whitney leans against <<his>> bedroom window, looking out.
			<</if>>
		<</if>>

		<br><br>
		<<if !_noOptions>>
			<<if _whitney_attention is 1>>
				<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2)>>
					<<brothelicon>><<link [[Take it further (0:15)|Whitney Flirt 2]]>><<pass 15>><<npcincr Whitney lust 1>><<npcincr Whitney dom 1>><</link>><<glust>><<gdom>><<promiscuous2>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<<insufficientStat "promiscuity" "to take it further">>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<if $milkshake gte 1>>
				<<if $whitneyromance is 1>>
					<<foodicon "milkshake">><<link [[Offer milkshake (0:20)|Whitney Milkshake]]>><<pass 20>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<set $milkshake -= 1>><</link>><<glove>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<<foodicon "milkshake">><<link [[Offer milkshake (0:20)|Whitney Milkshake Fail]]>><<pass 20>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<set $milkshake -= 1>><</link>><<glove>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
				<<if $whitneyromance is 1 and $daily.whitney.flirt is undefined>>
				<<brothelicon>><<link [[Flirt (0:15)|Whitney Flirt]]>><<set $daily.whitney.flirt to 1>><<pass 15>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<npcincr Whitney lust 1>><</link>><<promiscuous1>><<glove>><<glust>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $daily.whitney.chat is undefined>>
				<<if $whitneyromance is 1>>
					<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Chat (0:15)|Whitney Chat]]>><<pass 15>><<stress -3>><<set $daily.whitney.chat to 1>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><</link>><<glove>><<lstress>>
				<<else>>
					<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Chat (0:15)|Whitney Chat]]>><<pass 15>><<stress 6>><<set $daily.whitney.chat to 1>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><</link>><<glove>><<gstress>>
				<</if>>
			<<else>>
				<<if $whitneyromance is 1>>
					<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Chat (0:15)|Whitney Chat]]>><<pass 15>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>>
				<<else>>
					<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Chat (0:15)|Whitney Chat]]>><<pass 15>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
			<<if $location is "flats">>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Hang out (0:30)|Whitney Home Hang]]>><<pass 30>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<stress -6>><</link>><<glove>><<lstress>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $daily.whitney.ask is undefined and $location is "park">>
				<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask if something's wrong|Whitney Ask]]>><<set $daily.whitney.ask to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if !$daily.whitney.smoke and $whitney_smoke isnot undefined and $location is "park" and !playerIsPregnant()>>
				<<smokeicon>><<link [[Ask for a smoke|Whitney Park Cigarette Smoke]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if !$daily.whitney.chastityBeg and $worn.genitals.origin is "Whitney">>
				<<templeicon "pray">><<link [[Beg for release|Whitney Chastity Beg]]>><<set $daily.whitney.chastityBeg to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $whitneychastity is 1 and ($worn.genitals.name is "naked" or ($worn.genitals.integrity lte setup.clothes.genitals[clothesIndex('genitals',$worn.genitals)].integrity_max * 0.25 and $worn.genitals.origin is "Whitney"))>>
				<<lockicon>><<link [[Ask if your chastity cage can be replaced|Whitney Chastity Replace]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $loft_known is 1 and $loft_whitney is undefined and $whitney_bailey_met gte 1>>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Tell Whitney about the orphanage loft|Whitney Orphanage Loft]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $loft_whitney is 3>>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Tell Whitney that Bailey took the cigarettes|Whitney Orphanage Loft 3]]>><<set $loft_whitney to 5>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $loft_whitney is 4>>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Tell Whitney about the cigarette incident at the orphanage|Whitney Orphanage Loft 4]]>><<set $loft_whitney to 5>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<elseif $loft_whitney is 5>>
				<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Remind Whitney about the orphanage loft|Whitney Orphanage Loft 5]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if canGiftFood("Whitney") and $whitneyromance gte 1>>
				<<skinicon "give">><<link [[Give Whitney food|Whitney Gifts List]]>><<handheldon>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if StartConfig.sneaky and $location is "park" and ($whitney_home_stage lt 3 or !$whitney_home_stage)>>
				<<ind>><<link [[Progress home events|Whitney Park]]>><<set $whitney_home_timer to 21>><</link>> SNEAKY OPTION
				<br>
			<<elseif StartConfig.sneaky and $location is "flats" and $whitney_home_stage is 3>>
				<<ind>><<link [[Progress home events|Whitney Home Hang]]>><<set $whitney_home_timer to 21>><</link>> SNEAKY OPTION
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<whitneyoptionsleave>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "whitneyoptionsleave">>
	<<if $bus is "park" or $location is "park">>
		<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $location is "flats">>
		<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave (0:01)|Whitney Home Leave]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "whitneyexit">>
	<<if $bus is "park" or $location is "park">>
		<<set $daily.whitney.park to 0>><<run delete $daily.whitney.text>><<run delete $daily.whitney.textTrigger>>
		<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $location is "flats">>
		<<run delete $daily.whitney.text>><<run delete $daily.whitney.textTrigger>>
		<<link [[Next|Barb Street]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "whitneyRescueEnd">>
	<<endevent>>
	<<if $whitneyRescueSpecial>>
		<<switch $whitneyRescueSpecial>>
			<<case "scienceDissection">>
				You hasten back to Sirris' classroom and deliver your cargo, safe and sound.
				<<if $schoolstate is "first">>
					The rest of the class is busy dissecting frogs. Lacking a partner, you get one all to yourself.
					<br><br>

					<<gscience>><<scienceskill>>
					<br><br>

					<<link [[Next|Science Lesson]]>><</link>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					Class is already over by the time you get back. Sirris stands by the door.
					<br><br>

					"You didn't get lost, did you?" <<nnpc_He "Sirris">> takes the box with a smile. "It's no big deal. You just run off to class, okay?"
					<br><br>

					<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<<case "mathsNote">>
				You hurry back to the classroom. Whitney doesn't follow.
				<br><br>

				<<if $schoolstate is "second">>
					<<link [[Next|Maths Lesson]]>><</link>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					By the time you get back, class is already over. River stands by the door.
					<br><br>

					"You took your time, didn't you?" <<nnpc_He "River">> scrutinises you for a moment, before sighing. "What's done is done, I suppose. Hurry off to class."
					<br><br>

					<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<<case "mathsSent">>
				You hasten back to your spot by the door before River notices your absence.
				<<if $schoolstate is "second">>
					You arrive just as <<nnpc_he "River">> emerges.
					<br><br>

					<<nnpc_He "River">> gives you a suspicious look, but doesn't press the matter. "It seems I made a mistake. Come back in."
					<br><br>

					<<link [[Next|Maths Lesson]]>><</link>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					By the time you get back, class is already over. River stands by the door.
					<br><br>

					"Where on earth did you run off to? You weren't even in trouble." <<nnpc_He "River">> sighs and shakes <<nnpc_his "River">> head. "No matter. Go to class, and don't let it happen again."
					<br><br>

					<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<<default>>
				/* failsafe - should be inaccessible */
				You feel like you were doing something important, but you forgot what it was. You decide to aimlessly wander through the hallways instead.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><</link>>
				<br>
		<</switch>>
	<<else>>
		<<switch $whitneyRescueExit>>
			<<case "canteen">>
				<<link [[Next|Canteen]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<case "courtyard">>
				<<if $bus is "schoolfrontcourtyard">>
					<<link [[Next|School Front Courtyard]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[Next|School Rear Courtyard]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<<default>>
				<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
